abstract: >-
  A Python AI agent that reads, edits and creates files, runs its own checks,
  and stops when a deterministic verdict rather than a model says the work is
  done. Built one version per post in the "Build Your Own AI Agent" series,
  with each part tagged so the code in an article can be checked out directly.
